      "alt": "A spreadsheet supplies different values to job application forms in three tabs: J&J, Slack and NVIDIA. The grid pairs job titles Data Scientist, Manager and Engineer with prior companies Meta, Amazon and Google. Generalized Job Title and Company fields on each form receive values from the matching spreadsheet column."
